=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  sysctl container ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. web-01.example.net is a container:$
# Kernel and Files rows are its host's, Network rows its own.$
# All are shown with no verdict, and hardn sets nothing.$
$
# Kernel Settings ##############################################$
$
  [-] Kernel               Not Applicable in a container$
$
  Network ------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  ICMP redirects       1 accepted$
   -  IPv6 redirects       1 accepted$
   -  Source routing       0 refused$
   -  SYN cookies          1 on$
   -  Broadcast pings      1 ignored$
   -  Bogus ICMP errors    1 ignored$
   -  Sending redirects    1 on$
   -  Reverse-path filter  2 loose$
   -  Forwarding           0 off$
$
  Kernel -------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Kernel addresses     0 shown to users$
   -  Kernel log           1 root only$
   -  Address randomizing  2 full$
   -  Process tracing      0 unrestricted$
   -  Unprivileged BPF     2 off$
   -  Performance events   3 limited$
$
  Files --------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Hard links           1 protected$
   -  Symbolic links       1 protected$
   -  FIFOs in /tmp        1 protected$
   -  Files in /tmp        2 protected$
   -  In a container: hardn sets none of these.$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Apply settings       Not in a container$
                           [-] Unavailable$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0 or q]:$
$
$

